WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.687
Clone the Kettle sample app,

2
00:00:02.737 --> 00:00:08.085
a small coffee-order app with three screens and two components.

3
00:00:08.135 --> 00:00:13.255
Build it with xcodebuild, then boot the iPhone 16 simulator,

4
00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:17.512
install the app and launch it with xcrun simctl.

5
00:00:17.562 --> 00:00:23.112
Kettle opens on its Menu screen, which is what Scry will capture.

